    "instructions": "Anonymous, read-only discovery of nearby lab locations and indexed restaurant meals. No account, patient records, image uploads, meal logging, ordering, payments, or appointment booking. Use a location the user supplies for the task. Lab distances can use approximate city coordinates. Meal nutrition can be estimated or incomplete; ranking preferences are distinct from hard nutrient limits. Results do not establish current hours, availability, or allergy safety. Empty results describe indexed coverage, not proof that no nearby options exist.",
    "pages": [
