            "name": "find_lab_locations",
            "title": "Find nearby blood-draw locations",
            "description": "Find nearby Empirical blood-draw locations from a local Quest/BioReference directory. No authentication. Returns addresses, distances, coordinate accuracy and snapshot provenance. Hours and appointment availability are not checked; this does not book a test. An empty list means no indexed matches.",
